60\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5-XQ8wUoc9IQ7kNvwGStrJK&_nc_oc=AdpYyJWxYFR2pG-j1uzyn4dZtgQPtm5u5mjIOuOFdQxAPmXoK9x-pu40tAEYHEjPeMM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0lkqXDX7K1XhnCUu7eoGl8Oe-c8wq7-BL4unXFbfZIXQ&oe=69D797D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-k9CqRSMNWAQ7kNvwHS1uUd&_nc_oc=AdqYIUjxufHpTuCjqI3eRXIven8Ghq2j0JxH-Ea-5X-Qx_oqyUpRqZ9joqzkXc84TlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3LA-tz_QIdNPCI8OVBVxjbDRhN1ah3JgKRrjhU6kwbhw&oe=69D7A1AD"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ED4v_sq0KTcQ7kNvwFxCHGK&_nc_oc=AdpM0t57xtvZ6IgZXQf3KFJ4qWTNnmqy0wTHldpv_WSU5tYQkb7SX5SThhQdoPzy-zo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3iRqMiOUJOW56Ho0Auzbs-uGZstX0ftP0g3ktj3dFrUw&oe=69D799ED"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_c